{"sectionId":"trafficking/degradation","items":[{"id":"trafficking--degradation-k001","sectionId":"trafficking/degradation","unitId":"trafficking","subject":"biology","text":"잘못 접힌 ER 단백질은 샤페론의 도움을 받거나 ER-associated degradation을 통해 세포질로 옮겨져 분해될 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"trafficking--degradation-k002","sectionId":"trafficking/degradation","unitId":"trafficking","subject":"biology","text":"UPR은 단백질 접힘 부담을 줄이고 샤페론 발현을 증가시키는 반응이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"trafficking--degradation-k003","sectionId":"trafficking/degradation","unitId":"trafficking","subject":"biology","text":"유비퀴틴 부착은 E1 활성화효소, E2 결합효소, E3 연결효소의 협동으로 진행되며 E3가 기질 선택성에 기여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"trafficking--degradation-k004","sectionId":"trafficking/degradation","unitId":"trafficking","subject":"biology","text":"K48 연결 polyubiquitin은 대표적인 프로테아좀 분해 신호지만 모든 유비퀴틴화가 분해를 뜻하지는 않는다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"trafficking--degradation-k005","sectionId":"trafficking/degradation","unitId":"trafficking","subject":"biology","text":"26S 프로테아좀은 20S 촉매 코어와 19S 조절 입자로 구성되고 ATP를 사용하여 기질을 펼쳐 내부에서 절단한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"trafficking--degradation-k006","sectionId":"trafficking/degradation","unitId":"trafficking","subject":"biology","text":"거대자가포식은 이중막 자가포식소체에 세포질 성분을 담아 리소좀과 융합시키는 과정이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"trafficking--degradation-k007","sectionId":"trafficking/degradation","unitId":"trafficking","subject":"biology","text":"세포외 물질의 내재화는 엔도솜을 거쳐 재활용되거나 리소좀으로 이동한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"trafficking--degradation-k008","sectionId":"trafficking/degradation","unitId":"trafficking","subject":"biology","text":"단백질 반감기는 합성 속도뿐 아니라 분해 속도에 의해 결정된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"trafficking--degradation-k009","sectionId":"trafficking/degradation","unitId":"trafficking","subject":"biology","text":"프로테아좀: 주로 개별 세포질·핵 단백질.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"trafficking--degradation-k010","sectionId":"trafficking/degradation","unitId":"trafficking","subject":"biology","text":"리소좀/자가포식: 소기관과 고분자 구조 등도 분해.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"trafficking--degradation-k011","sectionId":"trafficking/degradation","unitId":"trafficking","subject":"biology","text":"유비퀴틴 E3는 기질 특이성에 중요하다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"trafficking--degradation-k012","sectionId":"trafficking/degradation","unitId":"trafficking","subject":"biology","text":"아니다. 연결 유형과 맥락에 따라 신호전달·내재화 등 다양한 기능을 한다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}